Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Content View Publication Fails
Symptoms: Content view publication tasks fail or hang indefinitely.

Solution:

# Check for conflicting tasks
hammer task list --search "state = running"

# Cancel stuck tasks if necessary
hammer task cancel --id <task-id>

# Check disk space
df -h /var/lib/pulp

# Restart services if needed
satellite-maintain service restart
Issue 2: Repository Synchronization Problems
Symptoms: Repositories fail to synchronize or show errors.

Solution:

# Check repository configuration
hammer repository info --name "RHEL8-BaseOS" --organization "Default Organization"

# Verify network connectivity
curl -I https://cdn.redhat.com/content/dist/rhel8/8/x86_64/baseos/os

# Reset repository sync
hammer repository delete-content --name "RHEL8-BaseOS" --organization "Default Organization"
hammer repository synchronize --name "RHEL8-BaseOS" --organization "Default Organization"
Issue 3: Content Promotion Validation Failures
Symptoms: Content doesn't appear correctly in target environments after promotion.

Solution:

# Verify content view version in target environment
hammer content-view version list --content-view "Complete-Environment-CV" --lifecycle-environment "Testing"

# Check for promotion task errors
hammer task list --search "label = Actions::Katello::ContentView::Promote AND result = error"

# Re-promote if necessary
hammer content-view version promote --content-view "Complete-Environment-CV" --version "2.0" --to-lifecycle-environment "Testing"
